# Auto-resolve the per-commit version bump on merges (issue #181).
#
# The pre-commit hook bumps the patch version on every commit of every branch, so any two
# feature branches diverge on these two lines and every merge of them conflicts there. The
# `ebversion` driver rewrites the version to the HIGHER of the two sides and merges the
# rest normally, so a version-only merge auto-resolves with no conflict and no stranded
# bump. The driver is registered per-clone by native/tools/install-git-hooks.sh — a fresh
# clone conflicts on these lines until that install step has run.
native/CMakeLists.txt merge=ebversion
native/src/main.cpp   merge=ebversion

# The git tooling scripts must be LF so bash executes them regardless of the CRLF checkout.
native/tools/merge-version.sh    text eol=lf
native/tools/install-git-hooks.sh text eol=lf

# Shipped slang shaders (issue #99) MUST stay LF: librashader's slang preprocessor is verified against
# LF here, and this repo is otherwise CRLF, so pin them so no autocrlf checkout rewrites them to CRLF.
native/resources/shaders/*.slang  text eol=lf
native/resources/shaders/*.slangp text eol=lf
